---
import Shell from '../../../../../components/AeroEvidenceShell.astro';
import status from '../../../../../../public/demos/aero/blind-validation-01-run-v1/current-status.json';
---
<Shell title="Aero · Benchmarks" description="External CFD comparisons and local-model operator trials, with their distinct evidence boundaries." path="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/">
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">AERO / BENCHMARK REGISTER</p>
    <h1>What was tested, and what did it prove?</h1>
    <p>External measurements test physical predictions. Local-model trials test guarded workflow behavior. These are separate claims.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="cards">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">EXTERNAL CFD / CHALLENGE 01</p>
      <span class:list={['status',status.result==='FAIL'?'failed':'pending']}>{status.result}</span>
      <h2>Blind Validation Challenge 01</h2>
      <p>NASA TM-4074 Table XIII: 18 angles × 3 grids. Frozen criteria and input-only execution code preceded the production runs. {status.completed} / {status.total} attempts finished in the published snapshot. Reference-withheld execution; supervisory setup was not fully blinded.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/blind-validation-01/">Read protocol and chronology →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL-MODEL / OPERATOR HANDOFF</p>
      <span class="status mixed">MIXED</span>
      <h2>Model-to-CFD workflow trials</h2>
      <p>Seven iterative airfoil attempts and the internal-flow model trials are retained, including rejected proposals. A local 7B model completed a solver run with operator help but failed strict observation; two bounded 14B workflows passed.</p>
      <p class="subtle">This tests proposal and evidence-reading behavior, not agreement with independent CFD measurements.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/model-operator/">Read every operator-trial outcome →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL + STRUCTURAL / SOURCE-DERIVED</p>
      <span class="status mixed">SYNTHETIC PREBENCHMARK</span>
      <h2>Samarmad-derived PCHE gate pack</h2>
      <p>A separate six-point synthetic shakedown of prediction freeze, criteria hashing, curved-interface transfer, generic OpenFOAM CHT, and generic CalculiX gates.</p>
      <p class="subtle">Synthetic pipeline proof only; not the publication-specific run.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/samarmad-synthetic/">Inspect the prebenchmark record →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL-HYDRAULIC / PUBLICATION-TARGETED</p>
      <span class="status failed">NUMERICAL FAIL · EXPERIMENT UNSCORED</span>
      <h2>Samarmad PCHE v1 — independent reconstruction</h2>
      <p>Three OpenFOAM CHT grids ran on the reconstructed Model 6 cell. Every grid misses the residual target, and medium-to-fine pressure drop shifts by more than 22%. The article was reviewed after freeze, but no exact matching experimental point could be established; v1 is not tuned.</p>
      <p class="subtle">The paper has no structural test. Exploratory CalculiX mapping failed its 100% coverage gate. The prediction hash is verified; external timestamp confirmation remains pending.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/samarmad-pche-publication-v1/">Read the run and post-reveal disposition →</a></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section><h2>Register policy</h2><p>Each future CFD, thermal or structural benchmark receives a versioned entry, source citation, frozen criteria, outcome, and comparison history. Failed and incomplete trials remain listed. Workflow scores are not presented as physical-validation scores.</p><a href="/software/aero/evidence/">Return to all evidence →</a></section>
</Shell>
